in Duisburg mercedes-benz has presented  the third generation of its top-selling  sprinter a lot has changed since it  first hit the streets in 1995 but one  thing has remained the same the van has  as wide a range of applications as ever  [Music]  as Emmanuel Schaefer points out the  sprinters lent its name to the entire  segment but it's much more versatile  than an ordinary transporter whether you  carry people or goods or use it as a  weekend camper or for customer service  mercedes wanted to cover all the bases  the new mercedes-benz is available as a  panel van pickup or tour and offers a  choice of three chassis x' the interior  is lean and uncluttered just as we've  come to expect all controls for the  multimedia and driver assistance systems  are right on the steering wheel but  Mercedes still offers plenty of  variations over 1,700 different  combinations the Sprinter is also  impressive on the road it came onto the  market with five engines to choose from  as well as front rear or all-wheel drive  the all-wheel drive comes with a 7-speed  automatic transmission  and to guarantee smooth sailing in the  future the sprinters adapting its drive  to go with the times  the Alecto amana will explains the  importance of electric drive not only  for passenger cars but also for  transport vehicles and this new Sprinter  has an electric model coming out soon as  well  Natha selfie month of course the East  printer can be customized for a broad  range of purposes  [Music]  it can carry three of four battery  elements depending on requirements for a  range of 150 to 200 kilometers  what's more the new Sprinter is also  safer and more networked than previous  generations  [Music]  [Applause]  my country poker Mon and vague lists his  favorite features networked web-based  services make it possible to call of  vehicle status information manage  assignments and even monitor the cargo  area all these data can also be called  up remotely everything you need is right  on board when it comes to driver assists  the crosswind brake cross traffic and  active Lane Keeping Assist come as  standard for vehicles exceeding 3.5  metric tons - Emmanuel the new  mercedes-benz Sprinter is just as  versatile as the challenges it must rise  to but other brands are also pursuing  the same global design concept in the  end it all comes down to one question  how much will it cost and Germany prices  start at just under 24,000 euros  [Music]
 

